实现方式说明适用TenantLineInnerInterceptor自动给 SQL 加 tenant_id 条件共享库共享表分 schema每租户一个库强隔离分数据源动态数据源大客户独立部署

1.2 租户上下文怎么传public class TenantContext &#123;
    private static final ThreadLocal&lt;Long> HOLDER = new ThreadLocal&lt;>();
    public static void set(Long id) &#123; HOLDER.set(id); &#125;
    public static Long getTenantId() &#123; return HOLDER.get(); &#125;
    public static void clear() &#123; HOLDER.remove(); &#125;
&#125;

@Component
public class TenantFilter implements Filter &#123;
    @Override
    public void doFilter(ServletRequest req, ServletResponse resp, FilterChain chain)
            throws IOException, ServletException &#123;
        try &#123;
            String tid = ((HttpServletRequest) req).getHeader("X-Tenant-Id");
            TenantContext.set(Long.valueOf(tid));
            chain.doFilter(req, resp);
        &#125; finally &#123;
            TenantContext.clear();      // 必须清，线程复用会串租户
        &#125;
    &#125;
&#125;

不清 ThreadLocal 是最危险的多租户漏洞：Tomcat 线程复用，下一个请求可能带着上一个租户的 ID 查数据。
