行为结果update 没有 where拦截delete 没有 where拦截deleteByMap(空 map)拦截需要全表操作加 @InterceptorIgnore(blockAttack = &quot;true&quot;)，并写清注释

生产环境必开：一次误操作 delete(null) 就是全表清空。
1.5 SQL 规范校验i.addInnerInterceptor(new IllegalSQLInnerInterceptor());

它会拦截：select * 之外的隐式转换、in 子查询过多、缺少 limit 的大表查询等（规则随版本变化）。属于”锦上添花”，不要指望它替代 code review。
1.6 SQL 注入器目标是把重复的自定义 SQL 抽成方法，像 BaseMapper 一样调用。
public class MyInsertBatch extends AbstractMethod &#123;
    @Override
    public MappedStatement injectMappedStatement(Class&lt;?> mapperClass, Class&lt;?> modelClass,
                                                 TableInfo tableInfo) &#123;
        String sql = "&lt;script>INSERT INTO %s %s VALUES %s&lt;/script>";
        SqlMethod sqlMethod = SqlMethod.INSERT_ONE;
        String columnScript = SqlScriptUtils.convertIf(
                "(" + tableInfo.getAllInsertSqlColumnMaybeIf(null) + ")",
                "list != null and list.size() > 0", true);
        String valuesScript = SqlScriptUtils.convertForeach(
                tableInfo.getAllInsertSqlPropertyMaybeIf(null), "list", null, ",", "(", ")");
        String keyProperty = tableInfo.getKeyProperty();
        String keyColumn = tableInfo.getKeyColumn();
        String sqlScript = String.format(sql, tableInfo.getTableName(), columnScript, valuesScript);
        SqlSource sqlSource = languageDriver.createSqlSource(configuration, sqlScript, modelClass);
        return this.addInsertMappedStatement(mapperClass, modelClass, "insertBatchSomeColumn",
                sqlSource, new NoKeyGenerator(), keyProperty, keyColumn);
    &#125;
&#125;

public class MySqlInjector extends DefaultSqlInjector &#123;
    @Override
    public List&lt;AbstractMethod> getMethodList(Class&lt;?> mapperClass, TableInfo tableInfo) &#123;
        List&lt;AbstractMethod> methods = new ArrayList&lt;>(super.getMethodList(mapperClass, tableInfo));
        methods.add(new MyInsertBatch());
        return methods;
    &#125;
&#125;

public interface UserMapper extends BaseMapper&lt;User> &#123;
    int insertBatchSomeColumn(List&lt;User> list);
&#125;

场景是否值得写注入器单表批量插入值得，insertBatchSomeColumn 是社区常用实现复杂多表查询不值得，直接写 XML一次性 SQL不值得

